<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Fury Warrior in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>Our set bonuses going into Phase 5 are, unfortunately, a little bit underwhelming compared to previous tiers. Both Fury and Arms Warriors will run 2 pieces of tier 16 instead of 4, as we have in previous phases. <br/>
<br/>The reason both specs opt for 2 pieces instead of 4 is the lack of power the 4-piece bonus provides. This would've been fine, as long as the tier pieces all provided us with great stat priorities. However, this is not the case. Only 3 out of the 5 pieces offer us our main secondary stat, Critical Strike. That being the Helm, gloves, and legs. The chest and shoulders are therefore significantly weaker than the off-piece alternatives available to us, and the 4-piece bonus does not compensate for those missed stats.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-16">
